   "name": "blurb",
   "type": "string",
   "value": "Blob joins. The floors must be walled in, with a DOOR to get in."
  },
  {
   "name": "intro",
   "type": "string",
   "value": "Living space now means a house: WALLS all the way round the floors and a DOOR so they can get in. Stone and water count as walls. A wall or a door is 1 log. There is a nook in the stone."
  },
